<div id="urduTextPath">علی اصغر (ع)/آہوئے کعبۂ قربانیٔ داور ہے حسین</div>
<p>Aaahoo kabaye qurbaniye dawar hai hussain<br>
Fiddiye ummate marhoom mai paiyambar hai hussain <br>
Baikas o bewatan o bedillo bepar hai hussain <br>
Sabar ayyub ki shamsheer hai hussain</p>

<p>Ghoke talwar phiri halkhaye sattar bari .<br>
Shukr bari kiya piyase ne magar har bari .<br>
____________________________</p>

<p>Ittefaqae alma ismai hai aye ahle aza .<br>
Paanch sharte hai zabihe k liye peshe khuda .<br>
Sharte awwal hai ke hawan na ho bhuka piyasa .<br>
Ahtiyatan badh mai zibha bhi do ab woh ghiza</p>

<p>Sharte sani hai ke ho jama toh taqeer karo .<br>
Jama ko waqte namaz isko na takbeer karo.<br>
____________________________</p>

<p>Teesri shart hai haiwan na ho paishe rawan .<br>
Ta daame zibha na hasrat se ho baham nighra.<br>
Sharte charum hai ke jaldi na karo ta imkan .<br>
 Ho churi tez magr hath ho narmi se rawan .</p>

<p>Sharte panjum hai churi bhi na dikhao isko .<br>
Zibha se phle qaza se na darao isko.<br>
____________________________</p>

<p>
Zibhe haiwan ki yeh sharte hai magar wawela <br>
Ashrafe qalq jo tha sibte nabi noore quda <br>
Aaaho aaye shere khuda fidaye rab dosara <br>
Khana kaisa ke na pani use katil ne diya</p>

<p>Halq tar karte hai qassab bhi qurbani ka <br>
 Qarta ummat ne na saiyyad ko diya pani ka <br>
____________________________</p>

<p>Zibha haiwan ka nahi hukm hai hawan ke huzur. <br>
Ya na shabbir the kuch dur na zainab thi dur.<br>
Aale ahmed dare khaima pe khade the majhboor. <br>
Lootti thi kahi kubra kahi abid ranjor .</p>

<p>Shah inko woh suye shahe ummam dekhte the <br>
Zibha hote the hussain ahleharam dekhte the <br>
____________________________</p>

<p>Eid e zilhij ko hai qurbaniye haiwa allah. <br>
Ho jo ek saal se kam zibha nahi uska rawan .<br>
Tum ko akbar ki jawani ki khasam ahle aza .<br>
Qatl asghar ko jo ummat ne kiya kya sin tha .</p>

<p>Shabe haftum se qalq dhudh na pine ka tha .<br>
Teesra faqha tha or sin tha cheh mahine kaa. <br>
____________________________</p>

<p>Na abhi kangi ke khabil the jhadule woh baal .<br>
Aaha qurbani asghar huvi kis tarha halal .<br>
Dhudh ka hoton pe aata tha ishara na sawal .<br>
Juz khuda kuch bhi na pehchan ta tha bano ka laal.</p>

<p>Maa ka dil iske ishare ko samajh leta thaa.<br>
Dhudh ki hoti thi qahish toh ro deta tha.<br>
____________________________</p>

<p>Ek bhi dant na nikla tha ali asghar ka .<br>
Ek balish ka kurta tha ali asghar ka .<br>
Chota qadh nanha sa jhula tha ali asghar ka.<br>
Dhudh pina bhi na chuta tha ali asghar ka .</p>

<p>Muh se maa baap ka bhi naam na ek baar liya .<br>
Bezaban bache ko bhi hurmula ne mar diya .</p>